  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you hits you with an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to force it to make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, the attack misses you instead, and if another creature is within range of the attack, the attacker targets that creature with the same attack roll; if several are, you choose which one. Once you take this Reaction, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest, but you can also restore its use by casting an Enchantment spell with a spell slot.</p>",
